0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T21:13:37-07:00","id":875242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/842225-conscription-national-service-jury-duty-and-other-annoying-legal-obligations#post842225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">how do you think supernaturals offset such things, I could see some of the SAD's investigations starting with mysterious draft dodging cases with people either disappearing, or getting disqualifed under mysterious circumstances...<br /> <br /> vampires pretty much HAVE to have a way around such things because of problems with sunlight<br /> <br /> Garou will probaly try to evade conscription unless they suspect something wyrmish behind enemy lines,<br /> <br /> They would probaly in most cases accept jury duty, unless they were URGENTLY needed by the local sept. (I could see pentex arranging a jury summons for a known garou, just to tie them up) as it lets them see how the Wyrm has affected the city they live in...<br /> <br /> Wraiths, its a nonissue, by and large.<br /> <br /> Ideas on others?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depending on your locale (country) some might be easy to get out of, such as in the US, being a single parent can for the most part get one out of jury duty. Select service is only based on records of those Registering for it (when they sign up to vote or get their first legal drivers license at 18), which means if one doesn't register/get a DL (real one that is), you won't get called on.<br /> Others, can be gotten out of with correct application of gifts, allies, favors, money etc.. Or just live off the grid!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/842225-conscription-national-service-jury-duty-and-other-annoying-legal-obligations?p=842508#post842508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Had 2 cases where Police officers arrrived at my door looking for the previous tennant of my apartment. I can only guess he was either under witness protection or a felon. possibly he moved without leaving a forwarding address...</div> </div> </div> </div>Back in Gulfport in 09, one of the Chiefs who just got to the base, had cops burst in on him after only a month living there, cause it took a long time for the cops to get the paperwork to go serve a warrant on the house's prior owner. So he had one heck of a wake up call when they came a knocking..<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/842225-conscription-national-service-jury-duty-and-other-annoying-legal-obligations?p=844261#post844261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jury Duty might provide another reason why having a Tzimisce or two in the Camarilla is handy: pay them to craft a ghoul to your likeness, and have them show up to Jury Duty. It would certainly be useful for Kindred who don't want to kill off their old lives, like with famous or infamous public figures.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or just have good old fashioned disguises at the ready for your ghouls..<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Coridan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/842225-conscription-national-service-jury-duty-and-other-annoying-legal-obligations?p=850291#post850291\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Or claim it as gambling winnings.</div> </div> </div> </div>That might work for small amounts, but as someone who went int a few down in Biloxi, they will usually make out tax paperwork FOR winners, especially for amounts 10k+<br /> <br /> And in some locales, if you try to pass it off as &quot;earnings from the local guys blackjack/poker nights&quot;, that might also earn you a 1 way trip to jail for illegal gambling at home..<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11674,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","user":"garhkal","date":". 04-27-2016, 12:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}